<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel has quorum for debt plan vote.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel has quorum for debt plan vote.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc said on Thursday enough shareholders were present at an extraordinary general meeting to allow it to go ahead with a vote on a plan to restructure 70 billion francs of debt.</p>
<p>&quot;The quorum of 25 percent has been reached,&quot; Eurotunnel executive chairman Patrick Ponsolle said at the meeting.</p>
</text>
